      "created_at": "2013-03-22T15:28:25.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Kismet put the jinx on Unity.</p><p>Two left feet : when target hero play a card he deal himself 1 melee damage point.</p><p>Does Unity take damage when using her power to put a golem into play or the construction pylon to put 2 golem into play.</p><p>ie is putting a card into play the same as playing a card ?</p>",
